<title>GREECE: COMMERCIAL BANK OF GREECE TO OPEN NEW BRANCH IN PAGRATI, ATHENS.</title>
<headline>COMMERCIAL BANK OF GREECE TO OPEN NEW BRANCH IN PAGRATI, ATHENS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>State Commercial Bank of Greece will open a new branch in Pagrati, Athens on May 19, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The new branch will offer the full range of Commercial's banking products and services, it said. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
